# Agent tooling
# Ignore all local Claude Code runtime state (live git worktrees, locks, loop leases)
# but keep the committed skill. Note `.claude/*` and NOT `.claude/**`: the single star
# lets git descend into the re-included subdirectory, the double star would not.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.opencode/*
!.opencode/command/
